import json
LOCK="Croco, a chubby mint-green baby crocodile with a rounded head, short snout, peach-cream belly, rosy cheeks, big chocolate-brown eyes, a gentle closed-mouth smile with no visible teeth, short arms and legs, chunky tail, wearing orange dungaree overalls with two small wooden buttons and a yellow star embroidered on the front pocket. Soft 3D animated preschool style, gentle pastel lighting, friendly and calm."
PEBBLE="Pebble, a small round lavender baby turtle with a cream-colored belly, a smooth lavender shell with exactly three soft sky-blue round spots, big round gray eyes, short stubby legs, a gentle closed-mouth smile, and no clothing or accessories. Soft 3D animated preschool style, gentle pastel lighting, friendly and calm."
S=["in a cozy pastel playroom, a close-up of Croco's face and shoulders from the very first frame beside a small tower of big soft pastel foam blocks that Pebble has built on a soft rug, Pebble sits next to the tower, Croco turns and his chunky tail gently bumps the tower, the light foam blocks tumble down slowly and softly onto the rug within the first second, Croco looks back with surprised round eyes and his mouth closed, vertical 9:16, steady close-up, slow gentle motion.",
"on the soft rug in the cozy pastel playroom, Croco kneels close beside Pebble with a sorry, gentle expression and one hand on his chest, Pebble slowly nods and gives a kind smile, fallen soft foam blocks around them, vertical 9:16, close medium shot, slow gentle motion.",
"Croco and Pebble stack big soft pastel foam blocks together into a new little tower on the soft rug, then both look at the camera with happy closed-mouth smiles, cozy pastel playroom, vertical 9:16, steady medium shot, slow gentle motion."]
NEG="no scary expressions, no sharp teeth, no rows of teeth, no teeth, no open mouth with teeth, no realistic reptile skin, no extra limbs, no text, no letters, no other franchises' characters, no flashing lights, no twinkling flashes, no fast camera moves, no hats or extra clothing, do not change the pocket star design."
EXTRA="No clothing or accessories on Pebble, no sharp beak, do not change Pebble's lavender color or the three sky-blue shell spots, no resemblance to other franchises' turtle characters. Big soft foam blocks only, no hard or sharp blocks, no crying, no tears, no angry faces."
P=[LOCK+" "+PEBBLE+" Scene: "+s+" Mouth detail: closed-mouth smiles for both characters, no teeth visible at any time.\nNegative: "+NEG+" "+EXTRA for s in S]
json.dump([{"prompt":p,"duration":4,"resolution":"720p","aspect_ratio":"9:16"} for p in P],open("params.json","w"),indent=1)
